From: AVCRT Development <avcrt@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] audio: lpass: guard the AVCRT codec TX mute lease

Expose decimator readiness and add a leased mute for the codec TX path.
Restore stock TX on expiry and teardown; revoke on affected route changes
without dropping a still-valid lease for an unchanged route.

diff --git a/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/asoc/codecs/lpass-cdc/lpass-cdc-tx-macro.c b/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/asoc/codecs/lpass-cdc/lpass-cdc-tx-macro.c
index af405de2e77814f889c68e7b7d8ad702ddce0652..920dea09e9b3bbd02885564c9bc8a7504f0e1b12 100644
--- a/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/asoc/codecs/lpass-cdc/lpass-cdc-tx-macro.c
+++ b/qcom/opensource/audio-kernel/asoc/codecs/lpass-cdc/lpass-cdc-tx-macro.c
